--- thirdparty/nccl/examples/02_point_to_point/01_ring_pattern/main.cc	2025-10-21 15:28:31.952879359 +0000
+++ comms/ncclx/examples/02_point_to_point/01_ring_pattern/main.cc	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
