diff -ruN thirdparty/nccl/ext-net/README.md comms/ncclx/ext-net/README.md
--- thirdparty/nccl/ext-net/README.md	2025-10-21 15:28:32.008878607 +0000
+++ comms/ncclx/ext-net/README.md	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
